{"id": 34433, "field": "description", "ja": "影の魔物を生み出して対象を攻撃させます。Shadowfiendが攻撃すると、術者はマナを$N1%受け取ります。範囲攻撃から受けるダメージが減少します。効果時間は$D1です。", "status": "unaligned", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5", "source": "draft-stat-words-o5-sg12@2026-09-30", "imported": "2026-09-30"}, "english": {"hash": "58d1a805ce140c56", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70291"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": [{"ja": "影の悪魔を作り出し、対象を攻撃します。\n$N1秒間持続します。", "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#1298"]}, "ruling": {"ruling": "reject", "by": "maintainer", "date": "2026-09-18", "note": "named unit: the Japanese writes a `$d` duration's unit itself, which is wrong whenever the client renders another unit and the runtime gate cannot see it; the model redrafts the line with $D placeholders (standing ruling: duration units are never assumed, ADR-028)"}}, {"ja": "影の魔物を生み出して対象を攻撃させます。Shadowfiendが攻撃すると、術者はmanaを$N1%受け取ります。範囲攻撃から受けるダメージが減少します。効果時間は$D1です。", "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5", "source": "draft-slots-spell-held-sg8@2026-09-18", "imported": "2026-09-18"}}], "ruling": {"ruling": "accept", "by": "maintainer", "date": "2026-09-18", "note": "redraft of a ruled line: this machine line replaces hand-written text the maintainer ruled `reject` (baked numbers / named duration units); the explicit, recorded decision that lets machine text replace a hand-written line (moved on 2026-09-30 to this line's stat-word swap, with the maintainer's decision that tooltip stat words use the interface's Japanese, style guide sg12)"}}
